# Agent mailboxes: real sending over SMTP and replies over IMAP (SENDING_PROVIDER=smtp).

@token = PASTE-AN-ADMIN-DEV-TOKEN
@senderId = PASTE-AN-AGENT-ID

### Known providers (servers and ports only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/mailbox-presets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The agent's mailbox and the deployment's sending mode (the password is never returned)
GET {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}/mailbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Connect (admins); leave "password" out later to keep the saved one
PUT {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}/mailbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preset": "microsoft_365",
  "smtp_host": "smtp.office365.com",
  "smtp_port": 587,
  "smtp_security": "starttls",
  "imap_host": "outlook.office365.com",
  "imap_port": 993,
  "imap_security": "ssl",
  "username": "agent@your-forwarder.com",
  "password": "APP-PASSWORD"
}

### Test the login (nothing is sent or read); status becomes verified or error
POST {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}/mailbox/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: mailbox-test-1

### Emails waiting for delivery, then what was sent or failed
GET {{baseUrl}}/outbox?status=queued
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Disconnect (deletes the saved password)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/senders/{{senderId}}/mailbox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
